On November 17, 2026, the Centers for Medicare & Medicaid Services (CMS) announced the 2027 standard Medicare Part B premium in a CMS fact sheet. The standard monthly rate is $209.40, up $6.50 from $202.90. The Part B field still starts at zero so the gross raise shows first, a button fills in $209.40, and higher-income enrollees enter the amount on their notice. For example, a $1,642 benefit with a $200 premium entered pays $1,501.